<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS6.SSS3" title="In IV-F Emergent Properties ‣ IV Results ‣ Drop the Hierarchy and Roles:How Self-Organizing LLM Agents Outperform Designed Structures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-F</span>3 </span>Shallow Self-Organized Hierarchy</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
