<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In V Discussion ‣ Drop the Hierarchy and Roles:How Self-Organizing LLM Agents Outperform Designed Structures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The Endogeneity Paradox: Why Neither Control Nor Freedom Wins</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In V Discussion ‣ Drop the Hierarchy and Roles:How Self-Organizing LLM Agents Outperform Designed Structures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Role as Emergent Function, Not Pre-Assigned Label</span></span></a></li>
