</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Drop the Hierarchy and Roles:How Self-Organizing LLM Agents Outperform Designed Structures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VI </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Future Work</span></span></a></li>
